'' std/chrono, a real module since 2026-10-10 (it was a facade over fb/chrono.bi, and is three
'' files now, at the 1500-line cap): LocalDate and its DayNumber, TimeSpan's static FromMinutes
'' and constructor, the nested namespace WallClock -- and, under 'using chrono', the tick
'' constants, public now.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc tests/modules/src/stdfacade/chrono.bas -o tests/modules/stdchrono.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/stdchrono.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 2026 9 28 1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: true -1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 10000000 2026-10-10
